%N A386862 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 2^(n-k) * binomial(2*n+1,k) * binomial(2*n-k-1,n-k).
%F A386862 a(n) = [x^n] (1+x)^(2*n+1)/(1-2*x)^n.
%F A386862 a(n) = [x^n] 1/((1-x)^2 * (1-3*x)^n).
%F A386862 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 3^k * (-2)^(n-k) * (n-k+1) * binomial(2*n+1,k).
%F A386862 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 3^k * (n-k+1) * binomial(n+k-1,k).
%F A386862 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence +8*n*a(n) +2*(-19*n-28)*a(n-1) +3*(-223*n+523)*a(n-2) +162*(-2*n+3)*a(n-3)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%F A386862 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence +2*n*(5*n-7)*a(n) +(-115*n^2+226*n-64)*a(n-1) -6*(5*n-2)*(2*n-1)*a(n-2)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A386862 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, 2^(n-k)*binomial(2*n+1, k)*binomial(2*n-k-1, n-k));
